        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "3421d239-f1b2-348a-a99b-c1161b05b468",
                "word": "OVNI",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "2d93c27d-35c5-4184-bb99-17074cb0c812",
                        "entry_id": "3421d239-f1b2-348a-a99b-c1161b05b468",
                        "tags": [
                            "singular"
                        ],
                        "form": "OVNIs"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "eb4e4fa9-71d2-31e3-b27f-f950ef1980ac",
                        "entry_id": "3421d239-f1b2-348a-a99b-c1161b05b468",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Variante de ovni."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "alt-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "173ffcce-7851-4fc0-9438-5c78406729da",
                                "sense_id": "eb4e4fa9-71d2-31e3-b27f-f950ef1980ac",
                                "text": "Dimanche 26 juillet : les OVNI sont évoqués dans l’article de l’Union « Astronomie à Liez : La tête dans les étoiles », retraçant l’édition de la Nuit des Étoiles à Liez."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "397cafd0-d895-4f2a-be73-caebaab97482",
                                "sense_id": "eb4e4fa9-71d2-31e3-b27f-f950ef1980ac",
                                "text": "On n’avait pas recherché les OVNIs parce que personne ne croyait que l’on pourrait jamais les trouver. Six mois plus tôt, ces engins fantomatiques étaient apparus sur Terre […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "78e91e21-7c60-47e6-9448-e8984e2ed128",
                                "sense_id": "eb4e4fa9-71d2-31e3-b27f-f950ef1980ac",
                                "text": "Ces images faisaient partie du soi-disant incident de l’OVNI de Nimitz, dans lequel plusieurs membres du personnel de la marine américaine ont rapporté avoir vu plusieurs OVNIs en forme de tic-tac (gélule), au-dessus de la mer, une affaire qui été étudiée par l’AATIP."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "cb84cf81-80e7-3274-8b06-00c2f06512af",
                "word": "ovni",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "ec3abd87-cdac-4b29-ac05-4f63781d3c82",
                        "entry_id": "cb84cf81-80e7-3274-8b06-00c2f06512af",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "ovnis"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "3cedb7b0-6317-4844-a6ff-c18b19ed53d9",
                        "entry_id": "cb84cf81-80e7-3274-8b06-00c2f06512af",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "OVNI"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fddf2342-2177-3ddc-a1cb-4fde11454ac8",
                        "entry_id": "cb84cf81-80e7-3274-8b06-00c2f06512af",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Objet volant non identifié : objet aperçu dans le ciel, sans que l’on arrive à l’identifier comme étant un objet, un corps céleste ou un phénomène connu de la science, souvent associé dans la culture populaire à une intelligence extraterrestre."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Science-fiction"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f074b77-de8d-4d86-a4d0-ce520ae6ddcb",
                                "sense_id": "fddf2342-2177-3ddc-a1cb-4fde11454ac8",
                                "text": "Et les ovnis, direz-vous ? Ne sont-ils pas la preuve d’une intelligence extraterrestre ? Ils le seraient s’ils existaient. Or rien n’est moins prouvé à ce jour."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1c6791ce-492f-4f5a-8747-238e8c355380",
                                "sense_id": "fddf2342-2177-3ddc-a1cb-4fde11454ac8",
                                "text": "Le Geipan est un service qui dépend du Cnes et qui étudie les phénomènes aérospatiaux non-identifiés, autrement dit, les ovnis."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "115088e0-5334-3be4-bf94-c3d0926ba807",
                        "entry_id": "cb84cf81-80e7-3274-8b06-00c2f06512af",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personne ou objet atypique, surprenant."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly",
                            "familiar"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "30857e3b-290a-454d-a7fb-6185812540ea",
                                "sense_id": "115088e0-5334-3be4-bf94-c3d0926ba807",
                                "text": "Ce type est un ovni dans le paysage politique !"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6cfada82-7834-4c66-a884-834f1fd9b43d",
                                "sense_id": "115088e0-5334-3be4-bf94-c3d0926ba807",
                                "text": "La psychologue se rappelle du ­regard de ses confrères qui la percevaient comme « un ovni psychologue » lorsqu’elle faisait passer des tests aux AVS."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6bfebae4-f3d0-43cb-9174-35563c2f4ef9",
                        "source_entry_id": "cb84cf81-80e7-3274-8b06-00c2f06512af",
                        "target_lang_word": "UFO",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "UFO",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8bee7dc0-8461-3fb5-b2c2-d7e83e12af9f",
                                        "entry_id": "1e1bb276-c49c-3c48-b4ff-a80b6f81e743",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "unbekanntes Flugobjekt (unidentifiziertes Flugobjekt, unidentifiziertes fliegendes Objekt)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f548eb5-e7de-4df6-8336-ea4223be1291",
                                                "sense_id": "8bee7dc0-8461-3fb5-b2c2-d7e83e12af9f",
                                                "text": "Das UFO am südlichen Himmel wurde von Spaziergängern am Nachmittag gesichtet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc97a5df-3077-4553-b707-740d3d64951c",
                                                "sense_id": "8bee7dc0-8461-3fb5-b2c2-d7e83e12af9f",
                                                "text": "„Das Mutual UFO Network (MUFON) ist eine US-amerikanische Non-Profit-Organisation, welche sich die wissenschaftliche Erforschung des UFO-Phänomens zur Aufgabe gemacht hat.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "11ba16b2-924a-3020-b6da-a8d13f36d12a",
                                        "entry_id": "1e1bb276-c49c-3c48-b4ff-a80b6f81e743",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ein fremdes Raumschiff"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "figurative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a9bc3eb6-d7c9-485e-b52b-0a2cc600f9ac",
                        "source_entry_id": "cb84cf81-80e7-3274-8b06-00c2f06512af",
                        "target_lang_word": "UFO",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "UFO",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a7a23bcc-b63d-3c05-9413-26f906bea9e5",
                                        "entry_id": "e054eaaa-8775-3549-b43d-32d9c169bd56",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Initialism of unidentified flying object; (loosely) an alien spacecraft."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "initialism"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22208a56-f71c-4162-ac6e-2790cc78ff5d",
                                                "sense_id": "a7a23bcc-b63d-3c05-9413-26f906bea9e5",
                                                "text": "After the case had been reported in the newspapers, Mrs. Gracindo de Souza, wife of a member of the local stock exchange, told police that she and her daughter had been driving down Alameda Sao Boaventura when they had seen an^([sic]) UFO hovering over the clearing where the bodies were later discovered."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4dcae52-55c1-4591-aab7-7685de67a32d",
                                                "sense_id": "a7a23bcc-b63d-3c05-9413-26f906bea9e5",
                                                "text": "To my way of thinking, there is every bit as much evidence for the existence of UFOs as there is for the existence of God. Probably far more. At least in the case of UFOs there have been countless taped and filmed—and, by the way, unexplained—sightings from all over the world, along with documented radar evidence seen by experienced military and civilian radar operators."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7257923b-709a-3792-b0da-3a1274a09c54",
                                        "entry_id": "e054eaaa-8775-3549-b43d-32d9c169bd56",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An \\\"unfinished object\\\" in knitting or other kinds of craft."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7fc48f8-ab5a-4fd4-83ad-d7f8c3f894e1",
                                                "sense_id": "7257923b-709a-3792-b0da-3a1274a09c54",
                                                "text": "UFOs differ from WIPs in that a WIP is a project one is actively pursuing, while a UFO runs the risk of never getting finished."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "261233fc-a15a-3ada-a9b4-7ebb3acd74fc",
                                        "entry_id": "e054eaaa-8775-3549-b43d-32d9c169bd56",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Initialism of ultrared flattened object."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "initialism"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cca58af4-fb27-42c8-b693-a01864d297aa",
                        "source_entry_id": "cb84cf81-80e7-3274-8b06-00c2f06512af",
                        "target_lang_word": "unidentified flying object",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unidentified flying object",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "43db8b43-8041-38ea-b801-903751f2a29c",
                                        "entry_id": "682d6344-ed03-35e5-98fa-be5e7ae2ca2c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anything not readily explainable appearing to move through or be suspended in the air."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c1b3fcc-6dac-4ead-8cdf-f053807b9758",
                                                "sense_id": "43db8b43-8041-38ea-b801-903751f2a29c",
                                                "text": "The lights seen over the city last night, originally termed unidentified flying objects, turned out to be spotlights from a car dealership reflecting on low clouds."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "49e83fc4-9ab8-33d3-ad9b-184aece02d6c",
                                        "entry_id": "682d6344-ed03-35e5-98fa-be5e7ae2ca2c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anything not readily explainable appearing to move through or be suspended in the air.",
                                            "Such things as seem to be discrete objects and comparable to aircraft."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38da3d42-f47e-4702-8c31-6f15a8771f8a",
                                                "sense_id": "49e83fc4-9ab8-33d3-ad9b-184aece02d6c",
                                                "text": "She said that the unidentified flying object then turned around, zoomed to a higher altitude, and loitered briefly before speeding off."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eab255a1-8155-423f-b073-41d81dbf635d",
                                                "sense_id": "49e83fc4-9ab8-33d3-ad9b-184aece02d6c",
                                                "text": "The U.S. and Canada are investigating three unidentified flying objects shot down over North America in the past three days. Militaries have adjusted radars to try to spot more incursions."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f4c0c823-2c7f-3a7a-a995-1aaa7045d5b6",
                                        "entry_id": "682d6344-ed03-35e5-98fa-be5e7ae2ca2c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An alien spacecraft."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f29c829b-13f7-4b84-a446-806d035e36c6",
                                                "sense_id": "f4c0c823-2c7f-3a7a-a995-1aaa7045d5b6",
                                                "text": "He said that the strange beings then took him aboard their unidentified flying object and examined his body."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
